The fastlowess C++ library is available through the unofficial CMake package:

    find_package(unofficial-fastlowess CONFIG REQUIRED)
    target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE unofficial::fastlowess::fastlowess)

Include <fastlowess.hpp> to use the C++17 interface. The port supports Windows
x64/ARM64 with MSVC, Linux x64/ARM64 with glibc or musl, and macOS x64/ARM64.
Shared linkage is required; Windows uses the release CRT. Debug and Release
consumers both use the upstream Release library. Rust and Cargo are not required.